  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## What's changed\n\nFirst release of the rebuilt binding, at the v11 Unified SDK generation.\n\n- Binds **MarketingCloudSDK 11.0.2** (was 8.x in the retired `sfmc-net-bindings-mobile`\n  packages) and ships the new **AppGroupSDK 1.0.0** requirement as a payload-only sibling\n  package, both fetched from tag archives with per-binary SHA-256 pins.\n- Depends on **SFMCSDK.Net.iOS 4.0.1.1** for the core, mirroring the native package manifests.\n- The hand-curated `ApiDefinitions.cs` was ported 8.1.x → 11.0.2 by header diff with a\n  bidirectional selector-parity check; the packed binding passes live simulator smoke tests,\n  including the module-configured initialization completion.\n- Migrating from `8.x`: the `sfmc_*` category class is now `MobilePushSDK`;\n  `PushConfig(Builder)`/`SFMCSdkPushModule` became `SFMarketingCloudSdkConfig(Builder)` +\n  `SFMarketingCloudSdk` attached via `SFMCSdkConfigBuilder.SetPushFeature`; the URL-handling and\n  event delegates are replaced by the v4 SFMCSDK event surface fed through the new\n  `sfmc_handle*Event:` hooks; device-token/notification-request setters left the category\n  surface (readers remain).",
